invariant: INV-25
file: p384.c
catches: p384_test
builds: bin/p384_test
reason: der_parse reads r and s from the whole signature buffer without
  holding them to the SEQUENCE's own length, so an Ecdsa-Sig-Value whose
  SEQUENCE ends before s does still verifies. test/p384_test.c's DER
  length boundary objects.

--- old
    if (rb.err || len >= 0x80 || len != rb_left(&rb)) {
--- new
    if (rb.err || len >= 0x80) {
